    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f093394ea04345d4a5a06db8d247ffbe",
      "statement": "Opening a team from the teams list navigates directly when that team is already active, otherwise calls `auth.switchTeam(team.id)` first and shows a \"Switching…\" badge on that row until the call settles, then navigates to `/teams/:id` on success.",
