      "id": "claim_d76822523f3a493794e8f15c885ac5b9",
      "statement": "Inviting a member sends `auth.invite(email, role)` with role defaulting to `member`; HTTP 409 is surfaced as \"This person is already a member of your team.\", and success resets the form and shows a confirmation.",
