    {
      "id": "claim_5433e65ec4034bc3a164f4c53726eddb",
      "statement": "Resending a pending invitation is subject to a 5-minute cooldown (`TeamDetail.RESEND_COOLDOWN_MS`): the button label is \"Wait {n}m\" while cooling down and \"Resend\" when allowed, the countdown is seeded from each invitation's last send (`createdAt` on non-expired invites via `withLastSends`) and restarted on resend success, and a `now` signal ticking every 30 seconds keeps the label live in this zoneless app; a refused resend surfaces the service reason in `resendError`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/pages/teams/detail/team-detail.html#L111-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6575146691bfa053855a51cdbe5874170f320bd27878af1b4736f3ace27dfd69:"
