    {
      "id": "claim_2f4d1e06dfb148d7a13a95b633cd3429",
      "statement": "Team deletion lives in an owner-only danger zone: an inline alertdialog confirmation precedes `auth.deleteTeam()`, success reloads memberships with `auth.loadTeams()`, and when teams remain but none is active the client auto-switches to the first remaining membership (switch outcome ignored for navigation) before going to `/teams`; otherwise it navigates to `/teams` directly.",
