    {
      "id": "claim_05f818e1baec44ce86261fa5f27ab502",
      "statement": "The account profile form (`firstName`, `lastName`) starts disabled and is only enabled after `auth.checkSession()` patches it from the user profile, so edits cannot race stale data; save calls `auth.updateProfile` and marks the form pristine on success.",
