    {
      "id": "claim_33abc32ed6204b378e9fe2ae6be10e53",
      "statement": "Change-password requires `newPassword` (minimum 8) but leaves `currentPassword` optional at the form level because OAuth-linked accounts may have no password; the backend verifies it only when a password exists, and accounts with `socialAuths` get a blank-allowed hint in the UI; save calls `auth.changePassword(currentPassword, newPassword)` and resets both fields.",
